      "content": "These are a good start. I like the tone. Can you expand a bit more on the \"character\" or the \"soul\" of each neighborhood for the brochures? Like, what kind of person really \"belongs\" in Oakwood Heights versus someone who would prefer the East District? I want to make sure the descriptions really hit those specific demographics correctly.",
